  "prefLabel": "Puc 102.03 Commission’s Office and Business Hours",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 102.03 Commission’s Office and Business Hours.\n\n(a) The commission’s office location, mailing address, and contact information are:\n\nNew Hampshire Public Utilities Commission\n\n21 S. Fruit St., Suite 10\n\nConcord, NH 03301-2429\n\nTelephone: (603) 271-2431\n\nEmail: ClerksOffice@puc.nh.gov\n\nWebsite: https://www.puc.nh.gov/\n\n(b) The commission’s business hours are 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m., Monday through Friday, excluding New Hampshire state holidays.\n\nSource. #14185, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc100.html"
